.TH YOGABOOK-GNSS-BUILD-RUNTIME 8 "August 2026" "yogabook-gnss 1.0.3"
.SH NAME
yogabook-gnss-build-runtime \- build a private Yoga Book GNSS runtime
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B yogabook-gnss-build-runtime
.I STOCK_SYSTEM_ROOT OUTPUT.tar
.SH DESCRIPTION
Copies the exact dependency closure needed by the validated BCM4752 daemon
from a user-owned, mounted Lenovo Android system image.  It validates the
known daemon checksum and creates a deterministic private archive.  No vendor
file is supplied by the yogabook-gnss package.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR yogabook-gnss-import (8)
